    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits advocating harm that threatens public peace and order.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "the damage or destruction, if it were to occur, would threaten the peace, order and good government of the Commonwealth.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The person commits an offence if they advocate harm that threatens public peace and order.";
